1
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:39,350
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 18=

3
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,480
I'm home.

4
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:08,280
Sorry.

5
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:09,920
Surgery ran long today,

6
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:10,680
so I'm late.

7
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:11,880
Are you hungry?

8
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:13,060
I'll make dinner.

9
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:13,920
Just a minute.

10
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:17,320
Did you

11
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:18,640
get an invitation

12
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,920
to an international program?

13
00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:30,380
Dr. Chen told me everything.

14
00:01:31,420 --> 00:01:33,220
He said it's a rare opportunity,

15
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,480
with just a few spots worldwide.

16
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,020
Was it...

17
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:44,940
because of me?

18
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:58,240
You don't have to.

19
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,540
Don't give up your dream for me.

20
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:02,720
I wouldn't give up

21
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:04,000
my dream for you either.

22
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,740
Neither of us has to do that.

23
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,460
My dream

24
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:14,820
was never to be a doctor.

25
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:21,020
It's always been you.

26
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:24,800
Let's watch this.

27
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:28,760
My brother...

28
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,280
I don't know what's gotten into him.

29
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,920
He's suddenly taken up boxing.

30
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,480
I asked him why,

31
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:34,280
but he wouldn't say.

32
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,400
Just said he wanted to.

33
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:38,780
Maybe he thinks fighting is cool.

34
00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:43,020
Oh,

35
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:45,700
didn't you say

36
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:48,100
you liked guys who could fight?

37
00:02:48,580 --> 00:02:50,620
Well, Zhou Yan's taken now.

38
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,720
How about my brother, then?

39
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:54,280
Are you crazy?

40
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,600
You've got to be kidding.

41
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,500
He's just a kid!

42
00:02:58,180 --> 00:03:00,420
Besides, that was ages ago.

43
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:03,460
I'm not into fighters anymore.

44
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,480
Recently,

45
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:06,860
I watched a medical drama.

46
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:09,880
The doctors in it were so cool.

47
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,360
In their white coats,

48
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,440
holding scalpels,

49
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:13,780
saving lives...

50
00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:16,300
That's the kind of guy I find hot.

51
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,480
(You're so fickle!)

52
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:20,760
Look.

53
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:22,160
This is the show. Look.

54
00:03:22,740 --> 00:03:23,340
Handsome, huh?

55
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,360
He really is.

56
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,120
Right?

57
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,200
I never imagined

58
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,060
a careless remark from childhood

59
00:03:38,060 --> 00:03:39,760
would affect you so much.

60
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:47,000
You say I'm your dream,

61
00:03:48,300 --> 00:03:49,660
but that's too much for me.

62
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:52,560
I don't want you to give up
everything for me.

63
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:55,240
If you ever regret it,

64
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,720
even a little,

65
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,300
you'll end up blaming me.

66
00:03:58,580 --> 00:04:00,020
And I'll blame myself.

67
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,480
I don't want that for us.

68
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:09,500
Let's take some time apart.

69
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:37,240
Lately, Gu Yuan

70
00:04:37,660 --> 00:04:38,540
has been taking calls

71
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:39,480
behind my back.

72
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,320
And?

73
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:48,160
He went over to the window

74
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,800
and kept his voice down.

75
00:04:51,940 --> 00:04:54,460
I could just make out

76
00:04:55,300 --> 00:04:56,380
a woman's voice.

77
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:00,080
Did you ask him?

78
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,100
No.

79
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:05,980
We're not even official.

80
00:05:06,460 --> 00:05:08,940
I'm in no position to question him.

81
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:10,520
So,

82
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,540
what will you do?

83
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,040
I don't know.

84
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,240
It just bothers me.

85
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:20,040
I can't bring myself to ask.

86
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,260
Then don't ask yet.

87
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,220
But ask yourself,

88
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,840
is it the call that bothers you,

89
00:05:28,380 --> 00:05:29,580
or not knowing

90
00:05:29,580 --> 00:05:30,660
where you two stand?

91
00:05:33,220 --> 00:05:35,880
When did you get so good at this?

92
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,540
I learned it from you.

93
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:49,080
Yesterday,

94
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,880
Pei Yiqiu and I had a fight too.

95
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:53,320
About what?

96
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:55,920
He got an invitation

97
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,720
to an international exchange program,

98
00:05:58,180 --> 00:05:59,080
two years long,

99
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,320
one of the best in his field.

100
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:02,600
But he turned it down.

101
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,580
He said

102
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:07,120
his dream wasn't to be a doctor.

103
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:09,660
It was me.

104
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,220
I'm dying of thirst,

105
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:16,060
and you're drowning.

106
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,080
What do you mean?

107
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,260
I'm worried Gu Yuan
doesn't love me enough.

108
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:23,080
And you?

109
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,760
You're worried he loves you too much.

110
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,760
Can't we even things out?

111
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,080
I have to get him to go.

112
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,660
I can't let him give up
everything for me.

113
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:36,660
Otherwise,

114
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,860
I'll feel indebted to him forever.

115
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,120
Then go tell him how you feel.

116
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:46,660
What about you?

117
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:52,120
I'll talk things through with Gu Yuan.

118
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,240
Whatever happens,

119
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,180
we have to face it first.

120
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:06,020
Let's stay in a little longer.

121
00:07:17,910 --> 00:07:23,310
(I love you, marry me.)

122
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:30,500
You...

123
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,820
What's all this?

124
00:07:46,670 --> 00:07:48,670
(I love you, marry me.)

125
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,400
I know

126
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,720
you've been upset lately.

127
00:07:57,100 --> 00:07:57,900
I'm sorry.

128
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,320
About that call...

129
00:08:00,620 --> 00:08:01,720
I never explained.

130
00:08:02,190 --> 00:08:04,700
(I love you, marry me.)

131
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:05,820
That call

132
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:08,220
was from a wedding planner.

133
00:08:11,130 --> 00:08:14,970
(I love you, marry me.)

134
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,800
I wanted to give you a surprise.

135
00:08:19,700 --> 00:08:20,580
Su Mu.

136
00:08:21,730 --> 00:08:23,650
(I love you, marry me.)

137
00:08:23,980 --> 00:08:25,500
Will you marry me?

138
00:08:54,170 --> 00:08:56,030
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
